/** G2 — the deliverable, described on every commercial page. The report IS the product. */
---
<section class="report">
  <h2 style="margin-top:0;">The report you receive</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every location the dog alerted on, mapped to unit, room and specific harbourage point.</li>
    <li>The visual confirmation result for each alert — confirmed, not confirmed, or inconclusive.</li>
    <li>Dated and signed by the handler who performed the inspection, with the certification on record.</li>
    <li>Photographs of confirmed findings where confirmation was possible.</li>
    <li>A written all-clear where nothing was found, stating what was searched and what was not.</li>
    <li>Retained on file so it can be reissued if it is needed later.</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="margin-bottom:0;">
    <a href="/compliance/what-a-defensible-report-contains/">What makes a report defensible →</a>
  </p>
</section>
